  <content>
  <section><title>Getting Ready for Unit 3 </title>
<para dir="ltr">To be ready for this unit, you need to be able to:</para>
<list>
  <item>Distinguish linear patterns from nonlinear patterns based on scatter plots.</item>
  <item>Identify positive and negative trends in a scatter plot.</item>
  <item>Interpret slopes and \(y\)-intercepts of graphs of linear equations.</item>
</list>
<para dir="ltr">Next, you will answer some questions that will help you see how ready you are for this unit. If you need help, some mini-lessons will help you brush up on anything you need to work on. </para>
 </section>
</content>
</document>
